{"headword":"קָטֹן²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>adj. small, insignificant</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.19\">1 S 2:19</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְטֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.17\">2 Ch 21:17</a>;—f., pl. and sf. supplied by <span dir=\"rtl\">קָטָן</span>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>small:</em> especially"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of youth = <em>young</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נַעַר ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:35\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.35\">1 S 20:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.7\">1 K 3:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.14\">2 K 5:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.6\">Is 11:6</a>; = <em>younger</em> of two brothers, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:17\" href=\"/Genesis.48.17\">Gn 48:17</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:13\" href=\"/Judges.1.13\">Ju 1:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:9\" href=\"/Judges.3.9\">3:9</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> comp.); <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקּ׳</span> <em>youngest</em> brother <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:13\" href=\"/Genesis.42.13\">Gn 42:13</a> + 10 times Gn (JE), son <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:5\" href=\"/Judges.9.5\">Ju 9:5</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.1\">2 Ch 22:1</a>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">קְטֹן בַּנָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.17\">21:17</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">גדול</span> = <em>young and old</em> (v. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָטָן</span> <strong>1</strong>), i.e. everybody <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:11\" href=\"/Genesis.19.11\">Gn 19:11</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 5:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.5.9\">1 S 5:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.2\">30:2</a> + (of pers. and things) v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.19\">19</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of things <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:19\" hre